<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News Corp sees share buy-back,growth.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News Corp sees share buy-back,growth.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rupert Murdoch's News Corp Ltd said on Wednesday it planned a buy-back of up to A$1.3 billion of preferred limited voting ordinary shares because it had cash in excess of its immediate needs.</p>
<p>News also said the group now looked forward to a rapid acceleration of its global growth strategy in the years ahead.</p>
</text>
